// A fleet's move (dll/test/fleetmove.c, `fmove`): Small Islands (map seed 1, start_epoch 9), P1's 6 dreadnoughts, 6
// cruisers and 4 frigates in the open sea in the north (around 60,14), given one move as the player's right-click
// gives it (selected, EEMPathTo executed) to 45,70 in the south: through the 10-tile channel between the islands at
// x 40-50, y 36-52, then open sea. At 4.5 min the fleet, packed as the first move left it, back north to 60,14 - the
// order a player gives after a fight. Every 2 s a sample (moving, standing short of the goal, done, the units'
// script states), after each move the times per ship: the jam before they get going, the waits on the way, the arrival.
wait_until(0.1min)
spawn(1, unit.s10_dreadnought_battleship, 58, 11, 6)
spawn(1, unit.s10_cruiser, 64, 15, 6)
spawn(1, unit.s10_good_hope_frigate, 56, 17, 4)
wait_until(0.4min)
cmd("fmove go 1 60 14 10 45 70")
every(2s, 0.4min, 4.4min, (run) => {
    cmd("fmove stat")
})
wait_until(4.45min)
cmd("fmove sum")
cmd("uinfo 45 66 12")
cmd("fmove go 1 45 66 14 60 14")
every(2s, 4.5min, 8.5min, (run) => {
    cmd("fmove stat")
})
wait_until(8.55min)
cmd("fmove sum")
cmd("uinfo 60 14 12")
